Package: lglasso
Type: Package
Title: Longitudinal Graphical Lasso
Version: 2.0.0
Description: Based on high-dimensional longitudinal data, 
             *lglasso* implements the  $L_1$ penalized maximum likelihood 
            estimation of the precision matrices and the corresponding correlation parameters. 
            *lglasso* can  estimate a single network (i.e., one-stage model) 
            or two networks (i.e., two-stage model). For the details of the algorithms, please refer to the paper Jie Zhou et al. 
            Identifying Microbial Interaction Networks Based on Irregularly Spaced 
            Longitudinal 16S rRNA Sequence Data 
            <doi:10.1101/2021.11.26.470159>.
